WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.748 --> 00:00:14.111
"The Battle Master is escaping!"

2
00:00:14.451 --> 00:00:15.171
Roxy shouted.

3
00:00:15.732 --> 00:00:16.792
The fighters ignored her.

4
00:00:17.372 --> 00:00:19.953
Many were still angry about the fake golden asteroid.

5
00:00:20.673 --> 00:00:21.513
One alien groaned.

6
00:00:21.533 --> 00:00:24.834
"This was a waste of my time!"

7
00:00:25.454 --> 00:00:26.174
He looked around.

8
00:00:26.194 --> 00:00:28.515
"How do I get out of this place?"

9
00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:30.676
Nebulon pulled out a device.

10
00:00:30.696 --> 00:00:33.249
"Hello? Yes, it's me.

11
00:00:34.089 --> 00:00:36.010
I was captured and had to fight in a big battle.

12
00:00:36.571 --> 00:00:37.471
I was very brave!

13
00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:39.252
Anyway, can you pick me up?

14
00:00:39.792 --> 00:00:40.853
I'll send you my location."

15
00:00:41.453 --> 00:00:43.454
The crowd, meanwhile, was growing angrier.

16
00:00:43.474 --> 00:00:46.156
"The Galactic Battle Bonanza is a rip-off!"

17
00:00:46.176 --> 00:00:48.557
"I want my money back!"

18
00:00:49.258 --> 00:00:50.118
Cozlin shrugged.

19
00:00:50.639 --> 00:00:51.859
"I guess we can leave."

20
00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:54.641
Wukong tucked his iron bar into his ear.

21
00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:56.542
Roxy folded her arms.

22
00:00:57.242 --> 00:00:57.923
"No way.

23
00:00:58.263 --> 00:01:00.104
The Battle Master is a bad guy!

24
00:01:00.544 --> 00:01:02.305
And we're the Galaxy Squad.

25
00:01:02.685 --> 00:01:04.505
We have to make sure he's punished."

26
00:01:06.326 --> 00:01:07.886
"That's right," Terrell said.

27
00:01:08.486 --> 00:01:09.647
Cozlin rolled her eyes.

28
00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:16.609
"Fine." They hurried through the exit and down a long corridor.

29
00:01:18.369 --> 00:01:21.210
Roxy peeked into a large room and saw the Battle Master.

30
00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:24.031
He was facing a doorway on the other side of the room.

31
00:01:24.051 --> 00:01:26.571
"I see him," she whispered.

32
00:01:27.172 --> 00:01:28.152
Wukong rushed in.

33
00:01:29.484 --> 00:01:31.766
"You can't escape us, Battle Master!

34
00:01:31.786 --> 00:01:34.889
We're Wukong looked closely at the villain.

35
00:01:34.909 --> 00:01:35.930
"He's not here."

36
00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:37.491
Everyone ran over.

37
00:01:37.511 --> 00:01:38.672
"What do you mean?"

38
00:01:39.093 --> 00:01:39.853
Cozlin asked.

39
00:01:40.614 --> 00:01:41.515
Wukong pointed.

40
00:01:42.255 --> 00:01:46.299
The Battle Master's helmet was open, and inside was a tiny cockpit.

41
00:01:46.819 --> 00:01:48.881
Bippo examined the Battle Master closely.

42
00:01:48.901 --> 00:01:51.023
"Empty, him!"

43
00:01:51.724 --> 00:01:53.285
"Hmm," Roxy said.

44
00:01:53.305 --> 00:01:56.528
"The Battle Master must be a small alien.

45
00:01:56.896 --> 00:02:00.278
This is a robot he uses to move around in and appear big."

46
00:02:00.898 --> 00:02:01.879
Terrell looked around.

47
00:02:01.899 --> 00:02:03.500
"Where is he now?"

48
00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:06.381
"I'm right here!"

49
00:02:07.081 --> 00:02:08.182
a deep voice thundered.

50
00:02:08.742 --> 00:02:11.744
Everyone spun around and saw a huge robot standing over them.

51
00:02:12.284 --> 00:02:14.205
A powerful arm knocked them all over.

52
00:02:14.225 --> 00:02:17.187
"Oof!" Roxy jumped back to her feet.

53
00:02:17.207 --> 00:02:18.548
"Who are you?"

54
00:02:19.308 --> 00:02:22.290
The robot's head popped open, revealing a tiny worm.

55
00:02:23.230 --> 00:02:25.731
"I am the Battle Master!"

56
00:02:27.424 --> 00:02:28.945
Wukong burst out laughing.

57
00:02:33.189 --> 00:02:34.410
just a worm!

58
00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:36.892
What's your name—Wiggles?"

59
00:02:37.793 --> 00:02:38.934
The worm glared at him.

60
00:02:38.954 --> 00:02:41.175
"Don't you dare laugh at me!

61
00:02:41.676 --> 00:02:43.838
My name is Plurf!"

62
00:02:44.778 --> 00:02:46.220
Wukong laughed even harder.

63
00:02:52.084 --> 00:02:55.107
Plurf shut the robot's head and then raised a fist.

64
00:02:56.716 --> 00:02:58.737
Ploosh! An energy beam shot toward everyone.

65
00:02:59.278 --> 00:03:02.420
They jumped out of the way, and the beam blew a hole in the wall.

66
00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:08.604
Zap! Cozlin fired a laser at the robot as Wukong leaped, swinging his iron bar.

67
00:03:09.044 --> 00:03:11.706
Bam! He left a big dent in the robot's leg.

68
00:03:12.206 --> 00:03:13.067
He swung again.

69
00:03:13.727 --> 00:03:14.988
Wham! Crack!

70
00:03:15.849 --> 00:03:17.970
The leg broke, and sparks shot out.

71
00:03:18.611 --> 00:03:22.894
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams burned a hole through the robot's chest.

72
00:03:23.434 --> 00:03:26.296
The robot stumbled back, toward the Battle Master robot.

73
00:03:26.828 --> 00:03:29.210
Wukong attacked it again with his iron bar.

74
00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:31.552
Soon the big robot stopped moving.

75
00:03:33.293 --> 00:03:35.415
Roxy flew up and pried the helmet open.

76
00:03:35.976 --> 00:03:37.477
She gasped.

77
00:03:37.497 --> 00:03:39.839
"Plurf isn't inside anymore!"

78
00:03:40.579 --> 00:03:42.141
Then she heard a door slam shut.

79
00:03:42.841 --> 00:03:44.463
Roxy looked behind the big robot.

80
00:03:44.843 --> 00:03:46.584
The Battle Master robot was gone!

81
00:03:47.325 --> 00:03:49.627
She peeked through a window in the door and saw it running.

82
00:03:49.647 --> 00:03:53.990
"Plurf is back in the Battle Master robot!"

83
00:03:54.571 --> 00:03:55.772
Roxy stomped her foot.

84
00:03:56.396 --> 00:03:58.841
"He's getting—" "Attention, everyone!"

85
00:03:59.262 --> 00:04:01.487
Plurf's voice came over the loudspeaker.
